---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { profile } from "@/data/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Ping Liang EET Notes" lang="en">
  <section class="container article">
    <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>Electrical studies, notes, and small builds.</h1>
    <p class="lead">{profile.headline}</p>

    <div class="article-content">
      <h2>Why I Keep These Notes</h2>
      <p>
        Small setup problems are easy to forget after they are fixed. I use this site to write down what happened,
        what changed, and what I would check first next time.
      </p>

      <h2>What I Write About</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Software setup, lab preparation, and troubleshooting.</li>
        <li>Course concepts with examples, diagrams, or screenshots.</li>
        <li>Small project work around controls, building systems, hardware testing, and power basics.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Direction</h2>
      <p>
        I am interested in controls, building systems, electrical troubleshooting, and hardware testing.
        Planned project notes connect those areas with course labs and small build exercises.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
